Name: EXAMPLE_JETS
Summary: Example of using different jet collections in Rivet
Status: VALIDATED 
Reentrant: true
Authors:
 - Martin Habedank <martin.habedank@cern.ch>
Description:
  'An example demonstrating the usage of different jet collections and reclustering.
  First of all, simple small-R jets (R=0.4) are collected.
  Secondly, these small-R jets are trimmed.
  Thirdly, the (untrimmed) small-R jets are used for reclustering.
  For this, different versions of reclusterJets() are used,
  with implicit and explicit plugin creation.'
Keywords: ['jets']
ReleaseTests:
 - $A LHC-13-Top-L